# Advanced Algorithmic Refinement (GSRTC/Zepto Deep Dive)

Maine aapke diye gaye saare 11 reference links (Zepto MDP, OATS Traffic Flow, GSRTC/Margdarshi architecture, Descartes Route Planning, API Rate Limiting) ka deeply analysis kiya hai. Humare UPBus architecture ko in world-class enterprise standards par laane ke liye maine humare current backend engines ko evaluate kiya aur yeh 3 major missing/incorrect logic find kiye hain jinko hum refine karenge:

## User Review Required
> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Refinement Scope**: Humare current engines basics mein bohot strong hain (HMM, Ray-Casting, MVCC lag chuka hai). Lekin Zepto ke 10-minute delivery model aur GSRTC ke OATS backend se compare karein toh humari ETA aur API hitting thodi rigid hai. Ye plan un engines ko "Dynamic" banayega.

