## Proposed Changes

### 1. API Traffic Control (Throttling & Rate Limiting)
**Reference**: *API Traffic Control: Choosing Between Rate Limiting and Throttling*
- **Flaw**: Humara `margdarshiClient.ts` directly loop mein fetch marta hai. Agar Margdarshi/UPSRTC server delay hota hai, toh humara server multiple parallel requests bhej kar unka server DDoSed (ban) karwa sakta hai.
- **Fix**: Main `margdarshiClient.ts` mein **Token Bucket Algorithm** implement karunga. Ye humari fetching ko throttle karega (e.g., max 5 requests per second), jisse humara IP Margdarshi server par block na ho aur safe streaming chalti rahe.

### 2. Markov Decision Processes (MDP) & Reinforcement Learning for ETA
**Reference**: *Zepto Delivery / Markov Decision Processes and Reinforcement Learning*
- **Flaw**: Humara current ETA engine (`eta.ts`) WMA (Weighted Moving Average) par chalta hai jo sirif time-of-day (jaise 8 AM par 25% slower) dekhta hai. Yeh deterministic (fixed) hai. 
- **Fix**: Main isko **MDP (Markov Decision Process)** mein upgrade karunga. Isme har stop ek "State" ban jayega aur next stop par jane ki "Transition Probability" dynamically compute hogi pichle buses ke historical data se. Isse Zepto ki tarah ETA minute-by-minute self-correct hoga.

### 3. Graph Theory & OATS (Optimizing Traffic Flow)
**Reference**: *Optimizing Traffic Flow (Scribd) & Descartes Route Planning*
- **Flaw**: Humara Graph routing engine physical distance (kilometers) ke hisab se routes ko traverse karta hai. 
- **Fix**: Main **Dynamic Edge Weighting** (Dijkstra/A* algorithm extension) implement karunga. Har route segment (Edge) ki weightage sirf distance nahi, balki live congestion (traffic speed) hogi. Agar ek segment par live bus ki speed 10km/h aa rahi hai, toh backend automatic uss edge ki "Cost" badha dega, aur aane wali buses ko real-time traffic delay dikhayega.

